"fillcolor\":null,\"line\":{\"color\":null,\"width\":0,\"linetype\":[]},\"yref\":\"paper\",\"xref\":\"paper\",\"x0\":0,\"x1\":1,\"y0\":0,\"y1\":1}],\"showlegend\":true,\"legend\":{\"bgcolor\":null,\"bordercolor\":null,\"borderwidth\":0,\"font\":{\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,1)\",\"family\":\"\",\"size\":11.68949771689498},\"title\":{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":{\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,1)\",\"family\":\"\",\"size\":14.611872146118724}},\"orientation\":\"h\",\"y\":1.0800000000000001},\"hovermode\":\"closest\",\"barmode\":\"relative\"},\"config\":{\"doubleClick\":\"reset\",\"modeBarButtonsToAdd\":[\"hoverclosest\",\"hovercompare\"],\"showSendToCloud\":false,\"displayModeBar\":false},\"source\":\"A\",\"attrs\":{\"4fdc695440fd\":{\"x\":{},\"y\":{},\"fill\":{},\"text\":{},\"type\":\"bar\"}},\"cur_data\":\"4fdc695440fd\",\"visdat\":{\"4fdc695440fd\":[\"function (y) \",\"x\"]},\"highlight\":{\"on\":\"plotly_click\",\"persistent\":false,\"dynamic\":false,\"selectize\":false,\"opacityDim\":0.20000000000000001,\"selected\":{\"opacity\":1},\"debounce\":0},\"shinyEvents\":[\"plotly_hover\",\"plotly_click\",\"plotly_selected\",\"plotly_relayout\",\"plotly_brushed\",\"plotly_brushing\",\"plotly_clickannotation\",\"plotly_doubleclick\",\"plotly_deselect\",\"plotly_afterplot\",\"plotly_sunburstclick\"],\"base_url\":\"https://plot.ly\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n\nTable: Total cost per year, new 2026 models, 15,000 miles a year. Source: AAA.\n\n|Class        | Electric|     Gas|  Hybrid|EV vs gas            |\n|:------------|--------:|-------:|-------:|:--------------------|\n|Medium sedan |  $13,662| $10,582| $10,204|EV costs $3,080 more |\n|Compact SUV  |  $11,888| $11,656| $11,201|EV costs $232 more   |\n|Medium SUV   |  $14,332| $14,431| $13,698|EV saves $99         |\n|Pickup truck |  $17,414| $16,626| $16,117|EV costs $788 more   |\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Where EVs win: running costs\n\nThe EV advantage is real. For a medium sedan, charging cost about **$712 a year** versus\n**$2,215** for gas, and maintenance was cheaper too (no oil changes, fewer moving parts, and brakes\nthat last longer thanks to regenerative braking).\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"plotly html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-b134bafeed9639a99dc3\" style=\"width:100%;height:371px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b134bafeed9639a99dc3\">{\"x\":{\"data\":[{\"orientation\":\"v\",\"width\":[712.5,2215,1436],\"base\":[0.55000000000000004,1.55,2.5499999999999998],\"x\":[1958.25,2934.5,2337],\"y\":[0.89999999999999991,0.90000000000000013,0.90000000000000036],\"text\":[\"Medium sedan, Electric - Fuel: $712\",\"Medium sedan, Gas - Fuel: $2,215\",\"Medium sedan, Hybrid - Fuel: $1,436\"],\"type\":\"bar\",\"textposition\":\"none\",\"marker\":{\"autocolorscale\":false,\"color\":\"rgba(31,78,90,1)\",\"line\":{\"width\":1.8897637795275593,\"color\":\"transparent\"}},\"name\":\"Fuel\",\"legendgroup\":\"Fuel\",\"showlegend\":true,\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"yaxis\":\"y\",\"hoverinfo\":\"text\",\"frame\":null},{\"orientation\":\"v\",\"width\":[771,2382,1731],\"base\":[0.55000000000000004,1.55,2.5499999999999998],\"x\":[1787.5,3145,2371.5],\"y\":[0.89999999999999991,0.90000000000000013,0.90000000000000036],\"text\":[\"Compact SUV, Electric - Fuel: $771\",\"Compact SUV, Gas - Fuel: $2,382\",\"Compact SUV, Hybrid - Fuel: $1,731\"],\"type\":\"bar\",\"textposition\":\"none\",\"marker\":{\"autocolorscale\":false,\"color\":\"rgba(31,78,90,1)\",\"line\":{\"width\":1.8897637795275593,\"color\":\"transparent\"}},\"name\":\"Fuel\",\"legendgroup\":\"Fuel\",\"showlegend\":false,\"xaxis\":\"x2\",\"yaxis\":\"y\",\"hoverinfo\":\"text\",\"frame\":null},{\"orientation\":\"v\",\"width\":[909,3066,2087],\"base\":[0.55000000000000004,1.55,2.5499999999999998],\"x\":[2238.5,3362,2945.5],\"y\":[0.89999999999999991,0.90000000000000013,0.90000000000000036],\"text\":[\"Medium 